{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 11517622985124999797,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Runtime PM",
      "source_hash": 6212267002088830573,
      "context_hash": 5825374837440997262,
      "translation": "Runtime PM",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265638Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Device-level power management: suspending idle devices while the system runs",
      "source_hash": 5826915520469568608,
      "context_hash": 9840635371163317212,
      "translation": "디바이스 수준 전원 관리: 시스템이 동작하는 동안 유휴 디바이스를 일시 중단하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스",
        "devices": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265639Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What is Runtime PM?",
      "source_hash": 14104900482285977269,
      "context_hash": 1564874622981815817,
      "translation": "Runtime PM이란 무엇입니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265639Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Runtime PM allows individual devices to enter low-power states while the rest of the system continues running.",
      "source_hash": 4436043641882192936,
      "context_hash": 10045519541731895509,
      "translation": "Runtime PM은 시스템의 나머지 부분이 계속 동작하는 동안 개별 디바이스가 저전력 상태로 들어갈 수 있게 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265639Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "A GPU can be powered off when no display is attached; a USB device can be suspended when idle; a PCIe NIC can cut power to its PHY between bursts.",
      "source_hash": 1002293665263187727,
      "context_hash": 6862533389565012375,
      "translation": "GPU는 연결된 디스플레이가 없을 때 전원을 끌 수 있고, USB 디바이스는 유휴 상태일 때 일시 중단될 수 있으며, PCIe NIC는 버스트 사이에 PHY의 전원을 차단할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "GPU": "GPU",
        "NIC": "NIC",
        "PCIe": "PCIe",
        "USB": "USB",
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265639Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "PM callbacks: struct dev_pm_ops",
      "source_hash": 469185997423131530,
      "context_hash": 13648150148009793849,
      "translation": "PM 콜백: struct dev_pm_ops",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "callback": "콜백"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265639Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Every driver can register power management callbacks:",
      "source_hash": 12642203270812390307,
      "context_hash": 17049441664040857409,
      "translation": "모든 드라이버는 전원 관리 콜백을 등록할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "callback": "콜백"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265639Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "A driver registers them with:",
      "source_hash": 8753393198190559883,
      "context_hash": 16577910715700913060,
      "translation": "드라이버는 다음과 같이 콜백을 등록합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "driver": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265639Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Usage counting: get and put",
      "source_hash": 5788092885811232626,
      "context_hash": 4710566271325407357,
      "translation": "사용 카운트: get과 put",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265639Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The core of Runtime PM is a **usage counter**.",
      "source_hash": 9114690560114190429,
      "context_hash": 6447229907351509352,
      "translation": "Runtime PM의 핵심은 **사용 카운터**(usage counter)입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265639Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The device stays active while the counter is > 0; it may be suspended when it reaches 0.",
      "source_hash": 16376584437117302883,
      "context_hash": 5476306529203526359,
      "translation": "카운터가 > 0인 동안 디바이스는 활성 상태를 유지하며, 카운터가 0에 도달하면 일시 중단될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The difference between `pm_runtime_put` variants:",
      "source_hash": 15318814950464299046,
      "context_hash": 14951040509499227330,
      "translation": "`pm_runtime_put` 변형들 간의 차이:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Function",
      "source_hash": 12017511910326844596,
      "context_hash": 13136484970556389957,
      "translation": "함수",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "function": "함수"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Behavior",
      "source_hash": 8025501245287060399,
      "context_hash": 4156652106931469483,
      "translation": "동작",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "`pm_runtime_put_sync`",
      "source_hash": 11278289933344293349,
      "context_hash": 9895823226284663300,
      "translation": "`pm_runtime_put_sync`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Runs the idle check synchronously if count reaches 0 — calls `runtime_idle()`, then `runtime_suspend()` immediately if nothing vetoes it",
      "source_hash": 8883219775928009876,
      "context_hash": 6566576624387246415,
      "translation": "카운트가 0에 도달하면 유휴 검사를 동기적으로 실행합니다 — `runtime_idle()`을 호출한 다음, 이를 거부하는 것이 없으면 즉시 `runtime_suspend()`를 호출합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "`pm_runtime_put`",
      "source_hash": 17902329615825847452,
      "context_hash": 6682465801431453452,
      "translation": "`pm_runtime_put`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Queues an async idle check if count reaches 0",
      "source_hash": 5267807718538820440,
      "context_hash": 13228923905779300906,
      "translation": "카운트가 0에 도달하면 비동기 유휴 검사를 큐에 넣습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "`pm_runtime_put_autosuspend`",
      "source_hash": 13101291900520298994,
      "context_hash": 6548610830542518590,
      "translation": "`pm_runtime_put_autosuspend`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Queues a suspend after the autosuspend delay if count reaches 0",
      "source_hash": 9577941005988027828,
      "context_hash": 8598523812786399180,
      "translation": "카운트가 0에 도달하면 autosuspend 지연 시간 후의 일시 중단을 큐에 넣습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "`pm_runtime_put_noidle`",
      "source_hash": 6190735144363811831,
      "context_hash": 8372513506126625624,
      "translation": "`pm_runtime_put_noidle`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Decrements but does not trigger suspend",
      "source_hash": 17069302758909727365,
      "context_hash": 7993801330236223428,
      "translation": "카운트를 감소시키지만 일시 중단을 유발하지는 않습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Autosuspend",
      "source_hash": 6180127109611253285,
      "context_hash": 2460808112592022600,
      "translation": "Autosuspend",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Autosuspend adds a configurable delay before suspension.",
      "source_hash": 6500239793294367251,
      "context_hash": 14291298641589368479,
      "translation": "Autosuspend는 일시 중단 전에 설정 가능한 지연 시간을 추가합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This prevents thrashing when a device is briefly idle between bursts of activity:",
      "source_hash": 13556244505336771872,
      "context_hash": 3435103874905845126,
      "translation": "이는 디바이스가 활동 버스트 사이에 잠깐 유휴 상태가 될 때 발생하는 스래싱(thrashing)을 방지합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The autosuspend delay is also exported to userspace:",
      "source_hash": 12624225061052800104,
      "context_hash": 16769070236286198912,
      "translation": "autosuspend 지연 시간은 사용자 공간에도 노출됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265641Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Runtime PM state machine",
      "source_hash": 8615541043404338095,
      "context_hash": 17311258415878621846,
      "translation": "Runtime PM 상태 머신",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "state machine": "상태 머신"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265641Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "There is no `RPM_IDLE` status — idle is a *callback*, not a status the device parks in.",
      "source_hash": 14732608327807509844,
      "context_hash": 16693711326565697260,
      "translation": "`RPM_IDLE` 상태는 존재하지 않습니다 — idle은 디바이스가 머무르는 상태가 아니라 *콜백*입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "callback": "콜백",
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265641Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The device remains `RPM_ACTIVE` the entire time its `runtime_idle()` callback runs; only if that callback (or the caller) goes on to request a suspend does the status change:",
      "source_hash": 4340314268653039306,
      "context_hash": 4926685132315080960,
      "translation": "디바이스는 `runtime_idle()` 콜백이 실행되는 동안 내내 `RPM_ACTIVE` 상태를 유지하며, 해당 콜백(또는 호출자)이 이어서 일시 중단을 요청하는 경우에만 상태가 바뀝니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "callback": "콜백",
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265641Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The real states (`enum rpm_status` in `include/linux/pm.h`) are `RPM_INVALID`, `RPM_ACTIVE`, `RPM_RESUMING`, `RPM_SUSPENDED`, `RPM_SUSPENDING`, and `RPM_BLOCKED`.",
      "source_hash": 14866717201199883297,
      "context_hash": 17532761904676465664,
      "translation": "실제 상태(`include/linux/pm.h`의 `enum rpm_status`)는 `RPM_INVALID`, `RPM_ACTIVE`, `RPM_RESUMING`, `RPM_SUSPENDED`, `RPM_SUSPENDING`, `RPM_BLOCKED`입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265641Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The idle callback",
      "source_hash": 5960889999778192526,
      "context_hash": 18079719835967504789,
      "translation": "idle 콜백",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "callback": "콜백"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:42.265641Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The idle callback is called when usage count reaches 0.",
      "source_hash": 14303942865139338822,
      "context_hash": 16477098266452519584,
      "translation": "idle 콜백은 사용 카운트(usage count)가 0이 되면 호출됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "callback": "콜백"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:28.979414Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "It decides whether to actually suspend:",
      "source_hash": 5867935376236207213,
      "context_hash": 16252893767180330255,
      "translation": "이 콜백은 실제로 suspend할지 여부를 결정합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:28.979416Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "struct device power fields",
      "source_hash": 3293205841887516731,
      "context_hash": 8082924545027203266,
      "translation": "struct device(디바이스 구조체)의 전원 필드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:32:31.990990Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Power domains",
      "source_hash": 10309002905382751317,
      "context_hash": 13692013360299780733,
      "translation": "전원 도메인",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:28.979416Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A power domain is a hardware block that can be independently powered off.",
      "source_hash": 5689773579726611740,
      "context_hash": 5704335847376323736,
      "translation": "전원 도메인(power domain)은 독립적으로 전원을 차단할 수 있는 하드웨어 블록입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:28.979417Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Multiple devices may share a domain — the domain stays on until all devices in it are suspended.",
      "source_hash": 10684954059288555529,
      "context_hash": 1953318554115745390,
      "translation": "여러 디바이스가 하나의 도메인을 공유할 수 있으며, 도메인은 그 안의 모든 디바이스가 suspend될 때까지 켜진 상태로 유지됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:28.979418Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "genpd usage (ARM SoC example)",
      "source_hash": 615707597886652787,
      "context_hash": 14374284276560504621,
      "translation": "genpd 사용법(ARM SoC 예시)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "SoC": "SoC"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:28.979418Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Runtime PM in interrupt context",
      "source_hash": 7961618729569013729,
      "context_hash": 5226467427699574423,
      "translation": "인터럽트 컨텍스트에서의 Runtime PM",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interrupt": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:28.979419Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`pm_runtime_get_sync` may sleep (to wait for resume).",
      "source_hash": 15195574108672833024,
      "context_hash": 17105731908876057255,
      "translation": "`pm_runtime_get_sync`는 (resume을 기다리기 위해) sleep할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:28.979420Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This is not allowed in interrupt context.",
      "source_hash": 4779427362278512022,
      "context_hash": 14575345722392601412,
      "translation": "이는 인터럽트 컨텍스트에서 허용되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interrupt": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:28.979420Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Use the non-blocking variant:",
      "source_hash": 2812603796959110041,
      "context_hash": 3697557171230560835,
      "translation": "블로킹하지 않는 변형을 사용하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:28.979421Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Observing Runtime PM",
      "source_hash": 11072646545563408305,
      "context_hash": 13965105708618017566,
      "translation": "Runtime PM 관찰",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:28.979421Z",
      "issues": []
